<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE II: </span>Quantitative comparisons for in-distribution (<span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">In-Dist.</span>) spatiotemporal upsampling scales (<math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=8,s=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=8,s=4</annotation></semantics></math>). <span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> and <span id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underline</span> indicate the best and the second-best performance, respectively.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.7" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T2.7.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.7.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" rowspan="3"><span id="S4.T2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">VFI Method</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" rowspan="3"><span id="S4.T2.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">VSR Method</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" rowspan="3"><span id="S4.T2.7.1.3.1" class="ltx_text">Events</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" colspan="4">GoPro <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib40" title="" class="ltx_ref">40</a>]</cite></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" colspan="4">Adobe240 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib101" title="" class="ltx_ref">101</a>]</cite></td>
