<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE III: </span>Quantitative comparisons with C-STVSR methods for out-of-distribution (<span id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">OOD</span>) spatiotemporal upsampling scales on the GoPro dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib40" title="" class="ltx_ref">40</a>]</cite>.
