<th id="S4.T4.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">MoTIF <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">37</a>]</cite></th>
